# Quantum Bayesian Networks for Bipolar II Disorder Prevention

**Structural Correspondence Between Entangled Quantum Circuits and Non-Parametric Causal Estimators: An Empirical Demonstration in Bipolar II Disorder Prevention with IBM Quantum Hardware Validation**

**Author:** Igor Villela Marroni  
**Affiliation:** Independent Researcher, Pelotas, Rio Grande do Sul, Brazil  
**Contact:** igorvmarroni@gmail.com

---

> ⚠️ **CRITICAL LIMITATION:** This is NOT a randomized controlled trial. Causal claims rest on untestable assumptions inherent to quasi-experimental designs. These findings justify—but do not replace—confirmatory randomized trials before widespread implementation.

---

## Overview

This repository contains all code, data access scripts, and reproducibility materials for the study investigating early behavioral intervention during major depressive episodes (MDE) in first-degree relatives of BD-II patients.

**Key findings:**
- Triangulated HR = 0.57 (95% CI: 0.48–0.67; I² = 16%), NNT = 9.3 (7.1–13.2)
- First empirical validation on real NISQ hardware that quantum entanglement functions as the circuit-level analog of non-parametric interaction modeling
- Entangled QBN degraded gracefully under DAG misspecification (+2.1%) vs. SuperLearner (+14.3%)

---

## Repository Structure

```
quantumtop/
├── README.md
├── LICENSE
├── requirements.txt
├── data/
│   ├── README_data.md          # Data access instructions (NHANES, MEPS)
│   └── codebook.md             # Variable definitions
├── quantum/
│   ├── qbn_entangled.py        # Entangled QBN circuit (IBM Quantum)
│   ├── qbn_product.py          # Product-state QBN circuit (control arm)
│   ├── bell_state_cert.py      # Bell state hardware certification
│   ├── chsh_test.py            # CHSH inequality test
│   └── ibm_jobs.md             # Publicly verifiable IBM Quantum job IDs
├── analysis/
│   ├── 01_iv_analysis.R        # Instrumental Variable (Arm 1)
│   ├── 02_rdd_analysis.R       # Regression Discontinuity (Arm 2)
│   ├── 03_stepped_wedge.R      # Stepped-Wedge DiD (Arm 3)
│   ├── 04_doubly_robust.R      # Doubly Robust AIPW (Arm 4)
│   └── 05_meta_triangulation.R # Fixed-effects meta-analysis
├── results/
│   ├── figures/
│   └── tables/
└── docs/
    └── preregistration.md      # Pre-registration of isomorphism hypothesis
```

