## Data Sources

All data are publicly available:

| Dataset | Source | Period | N |
|---------|--------|--------|---|
| NHANES | https://www.cdc.gov/nchs/nhanes/ | 2011–2020 | 8,965 |
| MEPS | https://meps.ahrq.gov/ | 2008–2019 | 84,653 person-years |

See [`data/README_data.md`](data/README_data.md) for download and preprocessing instructions.

---

## Quantum Hardware Certification

All quantum jobs were executed on **IBM Quantum (ibm_fez, Heron r2, 156 qubits)** on February 22, 2026, and are publicly verifiable:

| Test | Job ID | Result |
|------|--------|--------|
| Bell State Preparation | `d6dhdocnsg9c739bcri0` | Fidelity F ≈ 0.982 |
| CHSH Primary | `d6dhj3h54hss73b9otqg` | S = 2.767 ± 0.044 (17σ above classical bound) |
| CHSH Validation | `d6dhhkvg4t5c7386n00g` | Confirmed |

> CHSH S = 2.767 exceeds the classical bound (S ≤ 2) by 17 standard deviations and reaches 97.8% of the Tsirelson limit (2√2 ≈ 2.828).

---

## Five-Arm Identification Design

| Arm | Method | HR | 95% CI |
|-----|--------|----|--------|
| 1 | Instrumental Variable | 0.58 | 0.44–0.77 |
| 2 | Regression Discontinuity | 0.52 | 0.38–0.71 |
| 3 | Stepped-Wedge DiD | 0.61 | 0.48–0.78 |
| 4 | Doubly Robust – Linear | 0.59 | 0.49–0.71 |
| 5 | Doubly Robust – SuperLearner | 0.56 | 0.47–0.67 |
| Q1 | Entangled QBN | 0.568 | 0.47–0.68 |
| Q2 | Product-State QBN (control) | 0.61 | 0.50–0.74 |
| **—** | **Triangulated Estimate** | **0.57** | **0.48–0.67** |

