## Requirements

### Python (Quantum arm)
```
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

### R (Classical arms)
```r
install.packages(c("ivreg", "rdrobust", "did", "AIPW", "SuperLearner", "meta"))
```

---

## Reproducibility

1. Download NHANES and MEPS datasets (see `data/README_data.md`)
2. Run preprocessing scripts in `data/`
3. Run classical arms in `analysis/` (R scripts, numbered in order)
4. Run quantum arm in `quantum/` (requires IBM Quantum account)
5. Run `analysis/05_meta_triangulation.R` for final triangulated estimate

